  <name>sox-noise</name>
  <summary>Noise generator GUI powered by Sound eXchange (SoX)</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      SoX Noise is a GTK application that uses Sound eXchange (SoX) to generate white, pink,
      or brown noise in real time, as well as provide some filter controls
      and basic effects.
    </p>
    <p>
      It provides a simple interface for choosing the noise type and adjusting
      the controls, and it is extremely light on CPU.
    </p>
  </description>

